Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我看一眼恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think i'll take one look at a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会突然忘乎所以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And suddenly fall off the wagon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.11,0:00:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像经过了那么多事我还没得到教训似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if, after everything, i haven't learned my lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我女朋友 杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my girlfriend, jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！杰西卡！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! jess!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望过着普通人般的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna live some normal, apple-pie life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是普通 是安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not normal. safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一具皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一具皮囊 米伽勒的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the vessel. michael's vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer's no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.99,0:00:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,大天使长会杀死那个背叛者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archangel smote the crap out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个问题非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我可以像以前那样拯救苍生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish I could save people, like I used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意思说你想继续吸食恶魔血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … you mean when you were all hopped up on demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算杀了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your plan to kill lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很愚蠢 那根本没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's foolish. it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了解决之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如去新墨西哥洲找找 听说他幻化成墨西哥薄饼神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try new mexico. I hear he's on a tortilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这星期我已经杀了俩天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed two angels this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.55,0:00:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成了背叛者 这一切 都是拜你所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rebelled. and I did it … all of it … for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,全因为你的过失所致\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法继续猎杀恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in no shape to be hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能的话我们最好分开行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's best we just go our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在做梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.78,0:01:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿有区别么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the difference i'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.25,0:01:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.81,0:01:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.93,0:01:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可没有分手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't we been down this road before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:01:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过今非昔比\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我只想回到正常人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time, i wanted to be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我明白自己是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time… I know i'm a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.18,0:02:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是文字游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is all a big ball of semantics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在斯坦福大学的时候你就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even at stanford, you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白身体里有某种邪恶的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew there was something dark inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 也许你一开始就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep down, maybe, but…you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 那个东西杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, that's what got me killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚打完招呼 我就挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was dead from the moment we said hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.81,0:02:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法摆脱自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run from yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在逃避什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you running now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你在这里 杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here, jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相不相信我是在保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you believe i'm actually trying to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的阴影迟早会笼罩你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, the past is gonna catch up to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.19,0:02:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,和过去一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what happens then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:03:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们逐渐死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}People die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 他们的死和你密切相关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, the people closest to you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 别担心 我不会重蹈覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't worry, because I won't make that mistake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的歌 不同的调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same song, different verse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并没有因此而改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are never gonna change with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第5季第3集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是比尔·巴克纳探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, i'm detective bill buckner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.73,0:04:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你点什么 探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes how can I help you, detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那些贫血患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here about those patients … the exsanguinated ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吧 你快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat it, twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们商量好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,留点私人空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.33,0:06:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为自己屏蔽了天使雷达网了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was flying below the angel radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲍比告诉我你在这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby told me where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和萨姆要暂时分开一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam are taking separate vacations for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…你找到上帝了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… did you find god yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更关心的是我啥时能要回我的项链呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly, can I have my damn necklace back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我还没找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, i haven't found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才来找你 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why i'm here. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？一起寻找上帝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what … a god hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.74,0:06:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是指上帝 而是其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not god. it's someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大天使之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an archangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他杀死了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字是拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被一个忍者神龟天使给废了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wasted by a teenage mutant ninja angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从天上听说他正在人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard whispers that he's walking the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.99,0:07:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下机会难得\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a rare opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.69,0:07:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,找他干嘛？为了复仇吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what … revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了获取情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Information.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 等你找到那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what … you think if you find this dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能套出上帝的住址了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just gonna spill god's address.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们要困住他后来审问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we are gonna trap him and interrogate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就是末路狂花组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what … i'm thelma and you're louise,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,赤手空拳地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're just gonna hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,去怒海争锋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sail off this cliff together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要帮你 给我个理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one good reason why I should do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是米迦勒的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're michael's vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使不敢伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no angel will dare harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我当成你的挡箭牌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so i'm your bullet shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只有你肯帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are the only one who will help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅因州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.07,0:08:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次你把我瞬移到某个地方后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time you zapped me someplace,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,害得我便秘了一个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't poop for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.71,0:08:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开车去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 凯斯 你来玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Keith, you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看我们赌什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That depends … what are we playing for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为世界和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}World peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is that all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,能问你个事儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,问吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你做完厨房里的填字游戏的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You finish that, uh, crossword puzzle in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是吧 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, i-i guess. why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是纽约时报周六版的填字游戏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new york times saturday crossword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周你突然出现在这个小镇里不和任何人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blow into town last week. you don't talk to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看你显然是受过高等教育\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're obviously highly educated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你简直就像是… - 散发神秘气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're like this… - Riddle wrapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,的谜一般的人物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside an enigma wra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在来赌这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what we play for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢的话 你就请我吃晚饭 并告诉我有关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I win, you buy me dinner and tell me your life story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来挺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是太神秘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very misterioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,异物冰雹 闪电袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak hail, lightning strikes …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢 - 目前哈雷镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like it. - Now fire consuming the.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,正遭受大伙侵袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Town of hawley.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,据当地居民称 傍晚时分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locals say what started as a torrential hailstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,起先是出现暴雨冰雹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.01,0:09:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后骤然突现剧烈闪电袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly turned to massive lightning strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电引起的森林大火 现已蔓延20英亩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That triggered the fire now consuming more than 20 acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,正沿着17号公路肆虐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here along the route 17 corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.78,0:09:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,郡政府建议哈雷镇全体居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}County officials are advising all hawley residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备以应对可能的强制疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prepare for what could become mandatory evacuations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:10:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像世界末日到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it me, or does it seem like the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个县副治安官见过天使长\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deputy sheriff laid eyes on the archangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没失明吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he still has eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉那位官员 他见到了主的使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the officer that he witnessed an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那位官员告诉我们天使长在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the officer will tell us where the angel is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走进去告诉他真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna walk in there and tell him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 我们是凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because… we're humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果凡人们想干些非常坏的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when humans want something really, really bad…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 这样你才能当上总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…that's how you become president.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗明汉副官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy Framingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿朗佐·莫斯利 联邦调查局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alonzo Mosely, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.35,0:10:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是我的搭档 埃迪·莫斯康\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner, Eddie Moscone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是联邦调查局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是新手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh, he's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我们问你几个问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if we ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 到这里谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. sure. talk here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵几乎都快听不到东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hearing's all blown to hell in this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.24,0:11:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚有事故？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That happen recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.14,0:11:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 加油站的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah … the gas-station thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们才会来 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.11,0:11:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.65,0:11:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意把刚才发生的事讲给我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind just, uh, running us through what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,接到报警电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, call came in …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.35,0:11:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,四号公路的加油站外有骚乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disturbance out at the pump 'n' go on route 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的骚乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of disturbance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would not have believed my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会相信眼前发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't seen it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是暴乱 一场大规模的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking a riot … full-scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多少人 - 30 40\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many? - 30, 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的人 相互杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all-out, kill-or-be-killed combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.93,0:11:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么让他们发生冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what set them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能是天使和恶魔们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's angels and demons, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在世界上经常开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're skirmishing all over the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他讲的什么 我没听明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again what did he say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恶魔们 - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Demons. - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:12:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,心魔 你知道的 嗜酒 奸淫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons, you know … drink, adultery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有自己的心魔 沃尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have our demons, Walt. right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.65,0:12:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 接下来发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway… what happened next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪异的爆炸 那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freakin' explosion, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说是地下的一个汽油灌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they said it was one of those underground gas tanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh… I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是普通的火球 那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your usual fireball. it was, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure white.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油站在地面上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas station was leveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone was…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.21,0:12:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我看到有一个人跪在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I see this one guy, kneeling there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么的聚精会神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real focused-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上没有一点伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a damn scratch on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐尼·芬尼曼 那里的机械师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donnie Finnerman … mechanic there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me guess …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他随后就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just, uh… vanished into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, kolchak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在圣彼得医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's down at st. pete's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣彼得医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. pete's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.10,0:12:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他不是拉斐尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it that's not raphael anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.01,0:13:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一副空皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just an empty vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么米迦勒从我身体出来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is this what I'm looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是这幅德行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When michael jumps my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 一点也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,米迦勒的力量更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael is much more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它对你将会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be far worse for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,启示录\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Book of Revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bobby. how you doin'
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有去跑马拉松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I aren't runnin' any marathons, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,加伯 俄克拉荷马州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, garber, oklahoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现有个镇上出现了启示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a town up the road showing some revelation omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他到来之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And upon his rising,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会有冰雹与大火并带着鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There shall be hail and fire mixed with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着可不怎么令人愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ain't that delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:13:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚发生过雹灾和火灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already got hailstorms and fires.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:13:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜鲜血不久就会来到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing blood can't be too far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打来就是为了这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There a reason you're calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩没跟你说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我想你应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well… so I just thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪些猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to find out who's in the area,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟悉这个地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a man on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.45,0:14:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我看看能不能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me see if I can think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.89,0:14:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就近的最好的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the best hunter who might be in the immediate vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh … that'd be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行 鲍比 我不参与这些事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, Bobby. I'm sitting this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 我挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam … - I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 等等 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so sorry. - Hold on. sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶路撒冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerusalem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那里怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. How was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,干旱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.44,0:15:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,油\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这油很独特 珍稀少有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very special and very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就用这瓶香料油来抓拉斐尔啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, are we gonna…trap Raphael with a nice vinaigrette.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.35,0:15:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们这仪式什么时候开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this ritual of yours, when's it got to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.45,0:15:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你一直说抓住个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something … you keep saying we're gonna trap this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一招半式\N{\fnArial\fs30}But isn't that kind of like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能抓到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapping a hurricane with a butterfly net.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这次更难\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.67,0:15:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有活命的机会没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have any chance of surviving this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 今天是你最后一晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, odds are, you're a dead man tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.09,0:15:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地球上的最后一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, last night on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, uh… what are your plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.73,0:15:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,静静地坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I'd sit here quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 说吧 任何事都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. Come on. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.31,0:15:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人 花天酒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm booze, women.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前有跟女人交往过 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been with a woman before, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少跟天使有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or an angel, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想说 你还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean to tell me you've never been up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过一次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing a little cloud-seeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本没那闲功夫 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've never had occasion, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两件事我置信不疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two things that I know for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:31.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,一 伯特和厄尼是同性恋（美动画片《芝麻街》两主角）\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, Bert and Ernie are gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.61,0:16:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 你死之前得享受一次人间性福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, you are not gonna die a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不关心这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.03,0:16:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 凯斯怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - What happened to Keith?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫你萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called you Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 萨姆是我的中名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh… Sam's my middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keith Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是叫萨姆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, it's, uh, Samuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不像听起来那么蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's not quite as dumb as it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他老爸一起打猎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huntin' buddies with his dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过萨姆埃尔已经是独自打猎的高手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Samuel here is quite the hunter himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你捕杀鹿之类的动物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill deer and things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是那类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不妨去喝一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, why don't I get you guys some drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉这么冒然来打扰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Didn't mean to bust you back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it, uh, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,说正事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比电话我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bobby called.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.31,0:17:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分恶魔都过来聚会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major demon block party going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们为什么原因来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why what are they up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比说 你已经不参与此事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby told us you were off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.42,0:17:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.39,0:17:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,照理说 这没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's fine in theory and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们现在必须召集足够人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we could really use all hands on deck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别算我 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.23,0:17:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不行呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.17,0:18:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着萨姆 无意冒犯 到底是什么负担这么重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sam, no offense, but, uh, what baggage is so heavy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至让你无视该死的天启的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be stowed away for the freakin' apocalypse, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.71,0:18:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一句话就说了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.88,0:18:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着还有更多我们要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}More for us, then, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.99,0:18:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过等我们回来的时候啤酒你得准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey … beers are on you when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.43,0:18:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母指定你去猎小鹿的时候喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your parents were drunk when they named you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你向小鹿斑比抬起了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you shoot bambi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's a…long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有足够的野外生存经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough with the kung-fu, wandering-the-earth thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去买点吃的 我们继续谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna buy you dinner, and we're gonna talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.61,0:18:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳赛 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lindsey, i can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 唯一能避免流血的方法是答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. the only way to avoid bloodshed is to say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个罪恶的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a den of iniquity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.44,0:19:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该出现在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should not be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你全力反抗上天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you full-on rebelled against heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪恶就当是一个额外补贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iniquity is one of the perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,表演时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. what's your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字是卡西 你的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is cass. what's your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.39,0:19:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chastity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chastity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是命运安排什么的？老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that kismet or what, buddy huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 他喜欢你 你也喜欢他 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he likes you, and you like him, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,[希伯来语]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey. listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她要求信用卡支付 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she asks for a credit card, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.38,0:19:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 记住基本常识 知道么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, just stick to the basics, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要退缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not order off the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她去吧 猛男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get her, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我推你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me push you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 去你妈的 废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard! screw you, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.21,0:20:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不是好鸟 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you, too! god!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.11,0:20:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh! jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底做什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是看着她的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just looked at her in the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她这不是她的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And told her it wasn't her fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.66,0:20:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的父亲已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That her father, gene, ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为他讨厌在邮局工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was because he hated his job at the post office.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 大哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的一切上帝都不会出来干预\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole industry runs on absent fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是自然顺序\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's … it's the natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go. come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太好笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.22,0:21:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.49,0:21:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好长时间我没这样大声笑过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time since i've laughed that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.86,0:21:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的好长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's been more than a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备告诉我回到这里的那些人的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell me who those guys back there really were.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要说是狩猎伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't say hunting buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. um…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经一起做同一事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to be in the same business together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.18,0:21:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}What business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的沙拉怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,收保护费 你是黑手党\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness protection, right you're mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是黑手党\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.73,0:21:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.52,0:21:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想打探你的隐私 我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to pry. my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.16,0:22:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前和我哥哥一起做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to be in business with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是我还蛮擅长那个工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, i was… pretty good at the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我出了一些差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… I made some mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我做了一些我觉得不好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, i-i did some stuff i'm not so proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.71,0:22:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人受到了伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.22,0:22:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你磕的什么毒品？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.19,0:22:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.19,0:22:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对某些东西上瘾了 我熟悉那表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were hooked on something. I know the look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.51,0:22:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,清醒了3年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.77,0:22:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在酒吧工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work in a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.95,0:22:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 凯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, keith …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.95,0:22:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是最后一个给你忠告的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And i'm the last person to be giving advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do know that…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.59,0:22:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没人做过这样的坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has ever done anything so bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:23:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't be forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they can't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当油燃烧起来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the oil burns,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.91,0:23:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有天使敢靠近或是跨过火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No angel can touch or pass through the flames,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是活得不耐烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说我们给他套了个燃烧着圣火的牢狱之笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we trap him in a steel cage of holy fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.32,0:23:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 问个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, one question …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么召唤他降世到这人身上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell do we get him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.09,0:23:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常 天使和他的皮囊之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's … well, almost an open phone line…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.03,0:23:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会存在着特别的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between a vessel and his angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.77,0:23:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后就只需要再用对方法就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One just has to know how to dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.74,0:23:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.22,0:24:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿呢 拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.19,0:24:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来占有我吧 小兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get me, you little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是有那么点儿好奇 大概\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just out of curiosity, what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.97,0:24:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般我们需要等多久才能等来大天使呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The average customer wait time to speak to an archangel?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.98,0:24:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时都可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.00,0:24:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 浪费了我一整天的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a day I'll never get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.73,0:25:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.35,0:25:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.25,0:25:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.95,0:25:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞这么多不就是想多出出镜嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I thought you were supposed to be impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.44,0:25:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却把房间搞得黑灯瞎火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you do is black out the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个东海岸都黑灯瞎火才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the eastern seaboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.40,0:25:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是遵守圣约要圣怜悯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a testament to my unending mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.07,0:25:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就给你们好看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I don't smite you here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.41,0:25:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就是你在信口雌黄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe you're full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.98,0:25:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你根本就是在害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.21,0:25:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕上帝再次将卡西复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}That god will bring Cass back to life again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.48,0:25:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,并把你好好地教训一顿 你这纸老虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And smite you, you candy-ass skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.57,0:25:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便自我介绍下 我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way … hi. I'm Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.81,0:25:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然知道你是那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.64,0:25:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 还要感谢他 终于让我找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, thanks to him, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.58,0:25:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会对他下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.49,0:25:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不敢对他下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.62,0:26:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以抓他去见米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will take him to Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.49,0:26:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢 那 听起来真够吓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that…sounds terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真得很吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.02,0:26:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我又不得不告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, I hate to tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.16,0:26:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会仍你摆布\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.49,0:26:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你还记得撒迦利亚赏你的那个胃癌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you remember Zachariah giving you stomach cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.60,0:26:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 那真是 真是让人捧腹不已啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. that was … that was hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.77,0:26:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.71,0:26:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对我而言不过是雕虫小技\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have anything close to my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.18,0:26:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.82,0:26:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说有一件事你肯定压根就没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you didn't imagine one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.59,0:26:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.02,0:26:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你的到来我们早有准备 你这杂碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew you were coming, you stupid son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.58,0:27:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别看我 是他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't look at me. it was his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.79,0:27:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.79,0:27:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.06,0:27:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真没听说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.13,0:27:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经死了 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.25,0:27:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.97,0:27:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经打烊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bar's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.41,0:27:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是有事该告诉我啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something you want to tell me, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.21,0:27:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.25,0:27:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.50,0:27:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.33,0:27:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.33,0:27:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.74,0:27:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.21,0:27:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉和史蒂夫呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are Reggie and Steve?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.28,0:27:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Steve's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.78,0:27:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.35,0:28:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,正内脏外露地躺在街对面那间便利店外\N{\fnArial\fs30}His guts are laying roadside outside the hawley five-and-dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.38,0:28:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.03,0:28:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,道歉有个屁用 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}"sorry" don't cut it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.25,0:28:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.26,0:28:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.12,0:28:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 既然这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.03,0:28:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就我先开个头好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you some of my own, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.84,0:28:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进城 来猎捕一直追踪的那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go into town, we capture ourselves a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.76,0:28:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而等着我们确超过了十个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we get jumped by 10 more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.23,0:28:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫就这么死于非命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.58,0:28:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.96,0:28:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,再道几次歉也无济于事 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying it twice don't make it so, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.49,0:28:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是知道吗 有个恶魔 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you see, this demon, he, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.89,0:28:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉了我们一些事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told us things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.69,0:28:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的事儿 和你有关 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy things. things about you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.72,0:28:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔们骗你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.79,0:28:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.76,0:28:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在最后一次问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.40,0:28:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.70,0:28:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.97,0:28:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lindsey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.50,0:28:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.59,0:29:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no other explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.33,0:29:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可能是他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.50,0:29:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.91,0:29:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得20世纪的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the 20th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.21,0:29:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,21世纪有见得比那时好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think the 21st is going any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.21,0:29:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得如果上帝还健在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think god would have let any of that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.35,0:29:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会让这些灾难发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he were alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.43,0:29:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.19,0:29:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么又是谁赋予人类下三滥招数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then who invented the chinese basket trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.82,0:29:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.15,0:29:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃儿 你谈论的可是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my father you're talking about, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.79,0:29:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, who would be so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.59,0:29:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,以狗屁天启而沾沾自喜的混蛋嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}To know that his sons started the frigging apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.39,0:29:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不仅逃跑还玩失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who ran off and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.56,0:29:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下一群无头苍蝇以及孤立无援的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who left no instructions and a world to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.67,0:29:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么上帝只是潜逃消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So daddy ran away and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.11,0:29:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他该不会碰巧在邮局当差吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't happen to work for the post office, did he.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.11,0:29:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你来说很有趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is funny to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.31,0:29:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当下可是活在一个无神世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're living in a godless universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.55,0:30:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.58,0:30:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在班时 你和其他天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … you and the other kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.08,0:30:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只是打算在人间开个天启吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just decide to throw an apocalypse while he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.39,0:30:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们倦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.95,0:30:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want it to be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.86,0:30:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.26,0:30:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,重回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.97,0:30:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么上帝一死 你做了头\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what … god dies and makes you the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.10,0:30:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为就能为所欲为了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think you can do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.00,0:30:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.14,0:30:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的确能随心所欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever we want, we get.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.98,0:30:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样好吗 咱好好说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just take it easy, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.45,0:30:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把刀放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the knife down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.10,0:30:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.47,0:30:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔说的都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the demon said … it's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:30:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.57,0:30:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何区别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.51,0:31:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会不那么讨厌我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna hate me any less.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.21,0:31:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我会不那么厌恶自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I gonna hate myself any less.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.68,0:31:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.91,0:31:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想听你说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to hear you say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.92,0:31:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.13,0:31:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启是我打开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.70,0:31:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是上帝真死了 我又是怎么复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If god is dead, why have I returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.63,0:31:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁让我重生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.47,0:31:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否曾想过是路西法救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it ever occur to you that maybe lucifer raised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.01,0:31:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.01,0:31:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.88,0:31:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要所有能找到的堕落天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs all the rebellious angels he can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.85,0:31:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it adds up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.29,0:31:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.49,0:31:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.96,0:31:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.56,0:31:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我留这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.80,0:31:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.33,0:31:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有一天你能找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.03,0:32:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天 你是我们的手下败将\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today, you're my little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.01,0:32:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到他说的了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.49,0:32:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.22,0:32:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.93,0:32:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是恶魔之血 小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's go juice, sammy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.16,0:32:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.93,0:32:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,离你远点 那可是大错特错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from you wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.90,0:32:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是为你量身定做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.00,0:32:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 要是那恶魔撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, if that demon wasn't right as rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.67,0:32:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就都喝光试试 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down the hatch, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.54,0:32:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.04,0:32:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, here's what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.41,0:32:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了这玩意 然后变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna drink this, hulk out,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.18,0:32:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那些杀了我好友的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna waste every one of those demon scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.81,0:32:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,都杀光光\N{\fnArial\fs30}That killed my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.52,0:32:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然她就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or she dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.72,0:32:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.36,0:32:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你好友的死却换来这样的结局真是有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny how watching your best friend die changes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.39,0:33:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快喝了 你想喝的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You know you want it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.46,0:33:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿过去喝光吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just reach out and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.71,0:33:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 也没那么糟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Was that really so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.81,0:34:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.72,0:34:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我们不会杀回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think we won't be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.72,0:34:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我不会杀回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think I won't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.10,0:34:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.07,0:35:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我多想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'll be the first to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.47,0:35:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小骚货在撒谎 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}That this little crusad of yours is nuts but…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.68,0:35:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道失去父亲的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do know a little something about missing fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.59,0:35:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.78,0:35:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说有时候我到处找我父亲时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean there were times when I was looking for my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.11,0:35:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然理智告诉我他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When…all logic said that he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.33,0:35:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道 在我内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I knew, in my heart…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.14,0:35:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,总感觉他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.87,0:35:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会在乎某些忍者神龟的屁话 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares what some ninja turtle says, cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.28,0:35:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.89,0:35:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他还健在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe he's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.42,0:35:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.46,0:35:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.06,0:35:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.23,0:35:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.87,0:35:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.14,0:35:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.77,0:35:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.34,0:35:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到我会这么说 但我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I'm saying that, but I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.44,0:35:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我真的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.51,0:36:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你弟弟分开也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even without your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.22,0:36:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我弟弟分开尤其好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially without my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.49,0:36:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我为那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I spent so much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.36,0:36:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,操了那么多心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worrying about the son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.53,0:36:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我跟你在一起的这24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've had more fun with you in the past 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.76,0:36:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比跟萨姆在一起的几年都要开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than I've had with Sam in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.63,0:36:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你也不是什么有趣的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not that much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.90,0:36:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.17,0:36:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我对家人多投入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been so chained to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.04,0:36:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是现在一个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that I'm alone…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.68,0:36:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.39,0:37:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.92,0:37:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你现在的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your life now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.52,0:37:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你可以一直这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can just live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.92,0:37:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,像鸵鸟一样把头埋在沙土里的躲下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your head buried in the sand?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.19,0:37:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.13,0:37:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝知道我有多么想念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows how much I miss you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.91,0:37:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.48,0:37:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,人是可以变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.71,0:37:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当抱有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is reason for hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.55,0:37:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.33,0:37:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.63,0:37:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么如此确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.92,0:37:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你释放了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you freed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.15,0:38:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.01,0:38:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.21,0:38:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.16,0:38:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,找你可真难哪 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a hard one to find, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.70,0:38:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,比大部分人类都难找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harder than most humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.29,0:38:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你是不会告诉我你在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you'll tell me where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.57,0:38:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.34,0:38:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了你 我才能来到人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you, I walk the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.51,0:38:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想送你一件礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to give you a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.39,0:38:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给你所有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to give you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.44,0:38:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.55,0:38:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 萨姆 真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Sam. I-I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.82,0:38:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个尼克只是个临时替代品\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Nick here is just an improvisation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.96,0:38:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非首选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.00,0:38:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是能容纳我 勉强维持不会自燃而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can barely contain me without spontaneously combusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.37,0:38:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.30,0:38:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你以为你为什么会在那个礼拜堂里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think you were in that chapel?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.01,0:39:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你才能做到 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.08,0:39:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.65,0:39:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真正的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My true vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.09,0:39:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.02,0:39:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.22,0:39:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.39,0:39:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.19,0:39:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但一切已注定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.07,0:39:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I do…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.47,0:39:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会同意我进入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.60,0:39:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.37,0:39:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need my consent?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.67,0:39:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我是天使嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.55,0:39:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可杀死我自己也不会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill myself before letting you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.05,0:39:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll just bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.29,0:39:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.06,0:39:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我的心都碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart breaks for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.89,0:39:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肩上的担子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weight on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.43,0:39:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做过的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.10,0:40:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要做的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you still have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.70,0:40:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是其他人能够承受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is more than anyone could bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.61,0:40:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有其他的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was some other way…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.18,0:40:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.75,0:40:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会对你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.28,0:40:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never trick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.78,0:40:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会答应我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will say yes to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.65,0:40:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.46,0:40:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.59,0:40:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我比你更了解你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know you better than you know yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.87,0:40:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.27,0:40:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为舍你其谁呢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it had to be you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.34,0:40:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这非你莫属\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always had to be you.
